B.c3y=new A.fe(B.iO,"Smart Payment Picker with Defaulter Prioritization","Payment collection sheet now places students with overdue dues strictly at the top with prominent due badges, instant multimodal search (Name, Phone, #CC Admission ID, Desk), and offline cache loading.","Smart Picker","payments","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
B.c3z=new A.fe(B.lX,"Account Credit Balance for Renewals & Adjustments","Any plan adjustments or surplus payments are safely preserved in your personal library wallet balance and automatically applied to your next renewal.","Wallet Balance","receipt","/student/profile","View Profile")
