B.c3B=new A.fe(B.I9,"10-Second Express Counter Billing & Atomic Seat Parity","Lightning-fast cash payment recording with instant digital receipts and zero-drift concurrency safety ensuring double-seat allocations are completely prevented.","Billing & Parity","point_of_sale","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
B.c3C=new A.fe(B.kd,"Silent Reception & Noise Help Button","Study in complete peace. Discreetly alert reception about noise, AC temperature, Wi-Fi issues, or desk hygiene without leaving your seat or causing a disturbance.","Quiet Study","volume_off","/student/feedback","Explore Help Desk")
B.c3D=new A.fe(B.HZ,"Stable Student Profile Photos & Image Caching","Eliminated profile photo blinking across student passes by caching decoded base64 images in memory and removing redundant animation loops.","Zero Blinking","image",null,null)
